<title>USA: ADT begins notes tender offer.</title>
<headline>ADT begins notes tender offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADT Ltd said Wednesday its ADT Operations Inc unit is commencing cash tender offers for all outstanding 8.25 percent senior notes due 2000 and for all oustanding 9.25 percent senior notes due 2003.</p>
<p>The tender offers are part of the proposed merger of ADT Ltd and Tyco International Ltd, it said.</p>
<p>The tender offers will expire at 1200 EDT/1600 GMT on July 2, the company said.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc. is acting as dealer-manager for the tenders, the company said.</p>
</text>
